{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルが思いつかなくて頭に出てきた言葉がこれでした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の中がじょしらくでしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、横浜で個別握手会でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族のみんなは優しくてユーモア溢れる方が多いから毎回ほんとに楽しいんだ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/06/08/7284781/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装はシックだねーって言われることが多かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールもすっきりするから夏はよくやる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとノースリーブで握手会とかあんまりやった事ないかもっ\n新鮮だった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/06/08/7284781/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/06/08/7284781/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい事に誕生日の日の握手会が全部完売したとのことで、誕生日お祝いしたいのに行けない！って方が続出しています..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに早く完売でるのは本当に嬉しいかぎりです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会は9月でとうぶん空いちゃうけど、\nあみのこと忘れないでねー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/06/08/7284781/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくの稽古はみんなこうやって浴衣？を着てやっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉旅館に来た人みたいな感じだけど、\nこれがなかなか慣れなくて難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の浴衣と違うからすぐ着崩れしちゃうし座る時はいちいち裾を抑えながらじゃないといけないし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落語家さんって大変なんだなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/06/08/7284781/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、明日も早いのでそろそろおいとませするかな( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに乃木中は今週出ます！やっと！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな良かったら観てね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニャニャーイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......笑"}],"source":"archive"}